                obo:IAO_0000111 "related work textual entity"@en ;
                obo:IAO_0000112 """Excerpt from Žitnik and Zupan. Bioinformatics. 2015 Jun 15; 31(12): i230–i239. (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4542780/):

